        1. Elevate to root:
            ``` Bash
            sudo su -
            ```
        2. Install i2pd:
            ``` Bash
            apt install apt-transport-https
            wget -q -O - https://repo.i2pd.xyz/.help/add_repo | bash -s -
            apt update
            apt install i2pd
            ```
        3. Create separate server tunnels for the Monero P2P and RPC ports:
            ``` ini
            cat << EOF > /etc/i2pd/tunnels.conf.d/monero-mainnet.conf
            [monero-node]
            type = server
            host = 127.0.0.1
            # Anonymous inbound port
            port = 18085
            keys = monero-mainnet.dat

            [monero-rpc]
            type = server
            host = 127.0.0.1
            # Restricted RPC port
            port = 18089
            keys = monero-mainnet-rpc.dat
            EOF
            ```
            If you already used this guide, keep `monero-mainnet.dat` for `monero-node` so its advertised P2P address stays the same. The separate RPC key file creates a new address; update your wallets after restarting i2pd. Back up both key files.
        4. Restart i2pd:
            ``` Bash
            systemctl restart i2pd
            ```
        5. Find both Base32 addresses in the [i2pd tunnels page](http://127.0.0.1:7070/?page=i2p_tunnels). Under Server tunnels, use the address next to `monero-node` for P2P and the address next to `monero-rpc` for your wallets.

        6. Add the P2P address to your Monero [**config file** :link:{ title="Monerod Config" }]{{ config }}, enabling these options:

            ``` ini
            anonymous-inbound=yourp2pi2paddress.b32.i2p,127.0.0.1:18085
            tx-proxy=i2p,127.0.0.1:4447,disable_noise
            ```

            Replace `yourp2pi2paddress.b32.i2p` with the `monero-node` address. Do not put the RPC address in `anonymous-inbound`.
        7. The node is now available on I2P. You can check that the service is working by using `curl`:
            ``` Bash
            curl -x socks5h://127.0.0.1:4447 http://yourrpci2paddress.b32.i2p:18089/get_info
            ```
